OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'special' teen
OL,4,Awho died in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who was one of two to die
OL,7,Ffollowing a crash has been described as
OL,8,Fa "truly special person" who was "full
OL,9,Fof life and energy" by her family.
OL,11,FAmelia Miller, 19, of Stowmarket, was
OL,12,Fdriving a red Peugeot 107 when it was
OL,13,Finvolved in a crash with a silver
OL,14,FVolkswagen Passat in Little Stonham on
OL,15,F18 October.
OL,17,FShe was taken to Addenbrooke's Hospital
OL,18,Fin Cambridge where she later died.
OL,19,FMiller's male passenger died at the
OL,20,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
