OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'special' teen
OL,4,Awho died in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer family members, Chris, Jo and
OL,7,FIssac, have paid tribute to the
OL,8,F"daughter, sister, aunty and cousin",
OL,9,Fwho they said left school with
OL,10,F"fantastic grades".
